  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police are currently conducting an investigation into former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo regarding allegations of treason and illegal surveillance of the President. The case has expanded to include several high-profile individuals, specifically former aides to the seventh President of Indonesia, Joko Widodo, such as Devid Agus Yunanto and Widi Prasetijono. Recently, Devid Agus Yunanto failed to attend a scheduled questioning session at the Bareskrim Polri, which remains pending. Concurrently, authorities have clarified that Listyo Sigit Prabowo cannot formally resign from the police force due to the ongoing criminal investigation. Public and media scrutiny remains high, with reports also addressing misinformation surrounding his health status and broader speculation regarding his professional conduct and alleged motives behind the purported surveillance activities.",
